category: Libs
requires: cygwin-devel libartifastring0 libfftw3-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "Highly optimized physical simulation of a violin for sound synthesis (development)"
ldesc: "Artifastring (artificial fast string) is a highly optimized physical
simulation of string quartet instruments (violins, violas, and cellos) for
sound synthesis."
external-source: artifastring

